# Weapon box: get 1000 points from the debug menu, walk to the box behind the start, use it, see the weapon over it, take it with E.
# The debug points and GOD MODE only set up the use; journeys/economy.steps proves how points are earned.
debug GOD MODE
debug +500 POINTS
debug +500 POINTS
expect box.position 0.0 0.0 9.5
expect box.offer
expect hud.points 1000
state 01-points
face 180 0
hold move_forward
wait 25
release move_forward
wait 30
look 0 260
until hud.prompt_visible true 60
expect hud.prompt E WEAPON BOX 950
state 02-prompt
shot 02-prompt
tap interact
wait 5
expect hud.points 50
expect_not box.offer
expect_not hud.prompt E WEAPON BOX 950
look 0 -200
wait 5
state 03-offer
shot 03-offer
look 0 200
wait 5
tap interact
wait 5
expect_not hud.weapon PISTOL
expect box.offer
expect hud.prompt E WEAPON BOX 950
wait 40
state 04-taken
shot 04-taken
